Package: waqt-timer
Version: 1.3.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ahmed Fahad <ahmedfahad3596@gmail.com>
Description: Prayer waqt countdown in top bar
 Shows remaining time for current prayer and start of next prayer.
 District precise geocoding with Karachi 18/18 Hanafi default for Bangladesh.
 Works on GNOME (AppIndicator), KDE, XFCE, MATE.
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
